          "caption": "The Old  Fort's  current  physical  condition  is  mixed.  Inside  the  structure,  the  area  is  well-kept  and seems  to  suffer  very  few  problems  expect  the  odd  case  of  littering.  The  external  walls  however appear to be crumbing in places, and have experience weathering and material decay. \nThere is also  the problem behind the back  wall of the  fort with litter;  there  are large  waste heaps laying against the walls. This detracts from the aesthetic quality of the site and  could be a problem when the Old  Fort hosts large festivals.",
